{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/858e79903dc4e3da897453f344a66a1a.avif?t=1759350886\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a strange world trapped in a time loop, where your choices can change the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cast spells, talk to curious creatures, and link branching timelines to unlock lost memories and find your way home. Murky blends lighthearted humor with introspective, emotional storytelling in a wholesome-ish puzzle adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">About this demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This demo includes the first two chapters of the game, giving you a solid glimpse of the game's narrative style while showcasing the core mechanics, including two of the five spells available in the complete experience. The full version will feature improved overall quality thanks to your valuable feedback, so please don\u2019t forget to leave a review!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/c8a5d0b78804447abd432b198d97f47d.avif?t=1759350886\" width=798 height=104 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Solve puzzles with spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/ff3687b546bd237bf683a3b8aa72c6e7.poster.avif?t=1759350886\" width=650 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/ff3687b546bd237bf683a3b8aa72c6e7.webm?t=1759350886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/ff3687b546bd237bf683a3b8aa72c6e7.mp4?t=1759350886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trigger reactions  by understanding how each spell connects with the environment and the events around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/4b0939183f43f64fdd22e90142e2801f.avif?t=1759350886\" width=837 height=104 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Loop through a 3 day cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/e65c8126b0de4f055ac0e17904792790.poster.avif?t=1759350886\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/e65c8126b0de4f055ac0e17904792790.webm?t=1759350886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/e65c8126b0de4f055ac0e17904792790.mp4?t=1759350886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each character has their own needs, routines, and events. Discover their behavior across the 3-day cycle, and learn how to help them by solving their quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/a3b9072a69ec4ae3335fa84e8ef08658.avif?t=1759350886\" width=859 height=119 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Jump between timelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/0d79f5da71366f1d8d4241b0ddad683e.poster.avif?t=1759350886\" width=1000 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/0d79f5da71366f1d8d4241b0ddad683e.webm?t=1759350886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/0d79f5da71366f1d8d4241b0ddad683e.mp4?t=1759350886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Complete events (or leave them unfinished) to unlock new timelines, each with its own plots and events. Reveal fresh stories and other possibilities to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/3006b0583108e8d8664d0b27d180949c.avif?t=1759350886\" width=869 height=105 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Solve mini-puzzles to cast spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054770/extras/63cf5fbf8cf628c114ae979177cea7ce.poster.avif?t=1759350886\" width=892 height=500 ><source 